            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As a student, it can be easy to feel lost as you struggle against the tide of increasing pressures. At university you juggle lectures, tutorials and assignment deadlines, and on practice placements your energy is consumed by trying to fit in with the team and learning another set of clinical skills.</AbstractText>
